OL,3,ATwo men dead after glider crashes into 
OL,4,ALoch Leven                             
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said the deaths were   
OL,7,Fnot being treated as suspicious and    
OL,8,Finquiries were ongoing to establish the
OL,9,Ffull circumstances.                    
